### FinancIA Chile — API HTTP collection (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
### Reemplaza @baseUrl con tu URL local o producción

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@internalSecret = TU_INTERNAL_SECRET_DEL_ENV
@adminToken = TOKEN_JWT_SUPABASE  # Obtener con magic link en /

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### CMF — UF de hoy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmf/uf

### CMF — IPC último mes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmf/ipc

### CMF — TPM
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmf/tpm

### CMF — Verificar entidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cmf/entity?name=Banco%20de%20Chile

### Demo — Chat single turn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/chat
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

{
  "message": "¿Qué es la UF?"
}

### Demo — Chat with history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/chat
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

{
  "message": "y la TPM?",
  "history": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "¿Qué es la UF?"},
    {"role": "assistant", "content": "La UF es una unidad de cuenta reajustable según el IPC..."}
  ]
}

### Demo — Conversación multi-turno
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/conversation
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "Mi banco me cobra $4500 por mantención"},
    {"role": "user", "content": "¿es legal?"}
  ]
}

### Demo — Status del corpus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/status
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

### Métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

### Métricas Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/metrics/prom
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

### Admin — Listar conversaciones (requiere JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/conversations?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Detalle de conversación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/conversations/CONV_UUID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Override manual
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/conversations/CONV_UUID_AQUI/override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hola, soy un humano del equipo y te respondo personalmente."
}

### Admin — Métricas diarias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/metrics/daily?from=2026-05-01&to=2026-05-06
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Top topics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/metrics/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Lista de Reels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reels
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Trigger generate Reel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reels/regenerate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publish": false
}

### Admin — Lista normativa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/regulations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin — Cost summary últimos 7 días
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/cost-summary?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Internal — Reel publish (para n8n)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/reel/publish
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}

{
  "video_url": "https://example.com/reel.mp4",
  "account_id": "ZERNIO_IG_ACCOUNT_ID",
  "caption": "Caption",
  "hashtags": ["FinanzasChile", "CMF"],
  "topic": "UF de hoy",
  "script": "El cuerpo del guión"
}
